Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:00.90,0:06:03.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这就是约会啊…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:03.00,0:06:04.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不得了！真是不得了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:05.10,0:06:07.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}Shit！要叫小孩子拯救世界吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:08.50,0:06:10.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}时代改变了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:10.20,0:06:13.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}听说议会也对那机器人有所期待
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:13.85,0:06:15.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}对那种玩具吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:15.50,0:06:16.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}一群笨蛋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:17.40,0:06:21.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}有那种钱的话，还不如拨给我们用
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:25.80,0:06:28.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么你会在这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:28.70,0:06:32.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我陪她一起来的，从德国来出差嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:32.30,0:06:36.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我太大意了，事先就应该想到的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:36.80,0:06:38.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0450,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}喂！别乱碰人家啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:38.80,0:06:40.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}有什么办法啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:40.10,0:06:41.95,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}{}第三小队按预定时间出发
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:41.96,0:06:43.30,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{}值班的第七小队请到甲板上来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:40.00,0:06:42.70,TV,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,050)}[TV] 啊，为什么你会这么冷淡啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:42.70,0:06:44.21,TV,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,050)}[TV] 因为我对你的感情已经冷却下来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:44.50,0:06:48.00,TV,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,050)}[TV] 今天外边还是炎热的夏天，室外温度超过40度，
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:48.01,0:06:50.00,TV,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,050)}[TV] 但是…这股寒气是什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:50.00,0:06:52.00,TV,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,050)}[TV] 我的心情可是在零度以下哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:52.01,0:06:55.00,TV,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,050)}[TV] 啤酒也很冰冻哦，啊啊好冷啊！我需要大衣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:55.00,0:06:59.40,TV,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,050)}[TV] 只是你内心的冷气机太有效了，稍微把温度调高一点怎么样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:59.60,0:07:01.90,TV,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,050)}[TV] 那台冷气机就是你哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:01.91,0:07:04.90,TV,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,050)}[TV] 只有你自己像室外机一样热，像个傻瓜似的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:04.90,0:07:07.07,TV,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,050)}[TV] 请不要再冷却我的内心了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:07.17,0:07:10.70,TV,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,050)}[TV] 让我来温暖你那冷却了的身体吧，来吧，只我们 2 个人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:10.70,0:07:11.70,TV,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,050)}[TV] 很遗憾，
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:11.71,0:07:16.10,TV,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,050)}[TV] 能把我的内心用打火机点燃，放入燃料，注入燃油的不是你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:16.20,0:07:20.20,TV,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,050)}[TV] 他是谁？那个幸运的男人？难到是那个男人…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:20.20,0:07:22.43,TV,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,050)}[TV] 不是啊，是这只小狗哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:24.00,0:07:27.70,TV,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,050)}[TV] 那是什么嘛？难到是说我会输给这只可爱的小狗吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:27.80,0:07:31.56,TV,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,050)}[TV] 是啊，这个孩子不会像某人那样挑剔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:31.60,0:07:33.56,TV,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(050,050)}[TV] （笑）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:43.10,0:06:45.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}现在有男朋友吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:45.90,0:06:48.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这和你没有关系吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:48.70,0:06:50.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}真冷淡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:51.70,0:06:54.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}听说你与葛城同居
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:54.40,0:06:55.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}嗯…嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:56.10,0:06:59.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}她睡相不好的习惯改了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:02.30,0:07:04.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:04.40,0:07:06.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你胡说什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:07.00,0:07:09.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还是一样吗？碇真嗣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:10.10,0:07:11.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}…嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:11.10,0:07:13.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你怎么知道我的名字
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:13.80,0:07:15.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}当然知道啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:15.30,0:07:18.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}在这世界中你可是相当有名的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:18.00,0:07:22.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没经过任何训练就在实战中启动 EVA 的第三适格者
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:22.70,0:07:25.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}哪里…碰巧而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:25.70,0:07:29.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}碰巧也是命运的一部份，是你的才能
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:29.80,0:07:31.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那待会见吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:31.40,0:07:31.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:31.80,0:07:33.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这不是真的…是恶梦…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:48.60,0:07:52.78,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}第五小队出发完毕，将按预定时间返舰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:36.80,0:07:38.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}如何？碇真嗣怎么样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:38.80,0:07:40.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}无聊透了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:40.10,0:07:42.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没想到那种人竟会是被选上的第三适格者
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:42.60,0:07:43.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}幻想破灭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:43.50,0:07:48.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不过在突然发生的实战中他的同步率超过了 40% 哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:48.10,0:07:49.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不会吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:49.70,0:07:52.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}话说回来,那个舰长还真傲慢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:52.80,0:07:57.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}他是个自尊心强的人嘛，总会忍不住想讽刺几句的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:57.40,0:08:00.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}加持先生是个外向风趣的人呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:00.50,0:08:03.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}他一直就那副德行，那个笨蛋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:03.10,0:08:04.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}第三适格者
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:05.60,0:08:07.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}跟我来一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:15.40,0:08:18.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}二号机是红色的啊，我以前都不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:18.80,0:08:21.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不同的不只是颜色而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:22.10,0:08:24.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}再怎么说，零号机跟初号机
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:24.10,0:08:27.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}只能算是开发过程中制造的原型及实验型
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:27.40,0:08:31.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你没受过训练就能马上与机器同步就是最好的证明
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:32.40,0:08:34.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}但二号机可就不同了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:34.70,0:08:36.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这才是为实战而制造的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:36.80,0:08:40.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}世界第一台真正的 EVANGELION
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:40.00,0:08:41.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}也就是正式型的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:44.20,0:08:45.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}怎么回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:45.40,0:08:46.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}水中冲击波
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:48.00,0:08:49.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}爆炸离这很近
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:51.10,0:08:52.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:56.40,0:08:57.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}难道是…使徒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:57.90,0:08:59.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}那就是真的…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:01.50,0:09:04.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}怎么办？得回美里小姐那里去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:07.20,0:09:08.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}机会
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:14.10,0:09:17.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}各舰注意相互距离，进行规避
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:17.40,0:09:18.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}报告情况如何了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:19.00,0:09:20.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}辛柏林号（Cinbli）， 沉没
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:20.20,0:09:21.51,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}泰特斯安德洛尼克斯号（Titus Andronicus）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:21.52,0:09:23.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}无法确认目标
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:23.10,0:09:25.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}可恶，到底发生了什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:26.00,0:09:27.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}午安，我是 NERV 的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:27.50,0:09:31.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}要不要来一份看不见的敌人情报与对策呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:31.20,0:09:34.30,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}现在是战斗中，参观的人禁止进入
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:34.30,0:09:38.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}依我看这怎么都像是使徒的攻击
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:38.20,0:09:39.80,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}{}各舰自行攻击
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:39.80,0:09:41.20,BGS,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fad(050,050)}{}明白
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:40.00,0:09:41.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}白费力气
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:51.90,0:09:55.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这种程度无法贯穿 A.T.Field 的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:55.40,0:09:58.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不过使徒为什么会来这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:58.20,0:09:59.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}难道是二号机
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:03.00,0:10:04.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}喂，要去哪里啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:06.80,0:10:08.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}在这里稍等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:09.70,0:10:10.90,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}什么啊，真是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:19.20,0:10:21.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不要偷看，色狼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:21.70,0:10:24.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么男孩子都是这么又笨又色的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:32.50,0:10:34.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}明日香，要去了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:41.50,0:10:42.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}为什么不沉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:42.80,0:10:45.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}果然还是要 EVA 出马才能赢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:50.90,0:10:52.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}来，走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:53.50,0:10:55.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你也一起来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:58.10,0:11:01.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}喂，换作战服（Plug Suits）干什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:01.70,0:11:03.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}你是笨蛋吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:03.20,0:11:06.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}还用说吗，用二号机打倒那东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:07.80,0:11:10.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}这怎么行，美里小姐的许可呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:10.60,0:11:12.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}打赢后再申请就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:15.40,0:11:19.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}来吧，让你亲眼看看我精湛的技术
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:20.30,0:11:22.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}不过你可不要妨碍我哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:27.60,0:11:30.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}奇怪，好像是在找什么似的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:31.50,0:11:35.60,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}在这里碰上使徒来袭，这和当初讲的好像有点出入嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:35.60,0:11:40.40,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}所以才准备了二号机，还加了个备用驾驶员
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:40.80,0:11:44.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}最坏的情况下，你自己先脱离
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:45.30,0:11:46.50,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}我知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:49.60,0:11:51.70,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}LCL 注水
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:51.70,0:11:54.00,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}开始启动
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:54.00,0:11:56.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}开始神经连接
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:56.80,0:11:59.80,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}压接锁解除
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:59.80,0:12:01.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}开始同步
