Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:24.80,0:21:27.20,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}没错，这就是最早的人类…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:27.20,0:21:28.10,CNBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1022)\fsp3}亚当
